    question_text: "The shortest distance from the point \\(P(1, 2, 3)\\) to the line with vector equation \\(\\tv{r}(t) = \\ii - \\kk + t(\\ii + 2\\jj + 2\\kk)\\), \\(t \\in \\R\\), is",
    options: ["\\(2\\)","\\(4\\)","\\(2\\sqrt{5}\\)","\\(6\\)"],
