    difficulty: 'developing',
    diagram: {"kind":"drawing","title":"Part of a woodland food web","width":320,"height":172,"elements":[{"t":"line","x1":105,"y1":152,"x2":66,"y2":118,"arrow":"end","w":1},{"t":"line","x1":125,"y1":152,"x2":164,"y2":118,"arrow":"end","w":1},{"t":"line","x1":272,"y1":152,"x2":272,"y2":118,"arrow":"end","w":1},{"t":"line","x1":50,"y1":102,"x2":50,"y2":28,"arrow":"end","w":1},{"t":"line","x1":75,"y1":102,"x2":108,"y2":73,"arrow":"end","w":1},{"t":"line","x1":105,"y1":57,"x2":80,"y2":28,"arrow":"end","w":1},{"t":"line","x1":170,"y1":102,"x2":170,"y2":28,"arrow":"end","w":1},{"t":"line","x1":272,"y1":102,"x2":272,"y2":28,"arrow":"end","w":1},{"t":"rect","x":27,"y":12,"w":66,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":60,"y":23,"text":"Kookaburra","size":9},{"t":"rect","x":150.5,"y":12,"w":39,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":170,"y":23,"text":"Dingo","size":9},{"t":"rect","x":233.5,"y":12,"w":77,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":272,"y":23,"text":"Powerful owl","size":9},{"t":"rect","x":93,"y":57,"w":44,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":115,"y":68,"text":"Lizard","size":9},{"t":"rect","x":24.5,"y":102,"w":71,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":60,"y":113,"text":"Grasshopper","size":9},{"t":"rect","x":142.5,"y":102,"w":55,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":170,"y":113,"text":"Kangaroo","size":9},{"t":"rect","x":250,"y":102,"w":44,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":272,"y":113,"text":"Possum","size":9},{"t":"rect","x":95.5,"y":152,"w":39,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":115,"y":163,"text":"Grass","size":9},{"t":"rect","x":244.5,"y":152,"w":55,"h":16,"rx":3,"fill":"white"},{"t":"text","x":272,"y":163,"text":"Gum tree","size":9}]},
    question_text: "The diagram shows part of a woodland food web. A long drought kills most of the grass, but the gum trees survive.\nWhich animal’s food supply does not depend on the grass at all?",
    options: ["Kookaburra","Possum","Dingo","Lizard"],
    correct_index: 1,
    explanation: "Follow the arrows back from each animal. The possum eats gum leaves, not grass. The kookaburra and lizard depend on grass through the grasshoppers, and the dingo depends on it through the kangaroos.",
