    year_level: 'year_10',
    difficulty: 'proficient',
    question_text: "A social media post says: 'Canberra just had its coldest winter in 20 years, so global warming must have stopped.'\nWhat is the main flaw in this reasoning?",
    options: ["Canberra's temperatures are not measured carefully enough to be used as evidence.","Global warming only raises summer temperatures, so winters are not affected.","One season in one place is weather; climate change is a long-term trend in averages across the globe.","Cold winters are caused by the hole in the ozone layer, not by the climate."],
